{'symbol': 'DXCM', 'date': '2023-01-17 06:00:00', 'title': 'DEXCOM G6 REAL-TIME CGM SYSTEM NOW AVAILABLE TO ALL CLIENTS WITH TYPE 1 DIABETES COVERED UNDER THE NON-INSURED HEALTH BENEFITS PROGRAM', 'text': 'BURNABY, BRITISH COLUMBIA--( BUSINESS WIRE )--DEXCOM, INC. (NASDAQ: DXCM), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN REAL-TIME CONTINUOUS GLUCOSE MONITORING (RTCGM), IS PLEASED TO ANNOUNCE THAT COVERAGE FOR DEXCOM G6 RTCGM SYSTEM ON THE NON-INSURED HEALTH BENEFITS (NIHB) PROGRAM HAS BEEN EXPANDED TO INCLUDE ALL CLIENTS LIVING WITH TYPE 1 DIABETES. THIS ANNOUNCEMENT EXPANDS UPON COVERAGE ALREADY IN PLACE FOR CLIENTS AGED 2 TO 19 ON INTENSIVE INSULIN THERAPY, GIVING EVEN MORE FIRST NATIONS AND INUIT PEOPLE ACCESS TO THIS STANDARD OF CARE, POTENTIALLY HELPING THEM TO HAVE MORE CONTROL OVER A LIFE-LONG CHRONIC ILLNESS.'}